{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And the name of the one.</b> It is the usage of the holy language to say sometimes \"the second\" and sometimes \"the one,\" as in \"and the name of the one was Bozez\" and \"and the name of the one was Seneh\" (1 Samuel 14:4)." "And the word \"said\" is lacking, after \"for the Elohim of my father was my help,\" and it is not written \"for he said, the Elohim of my father,\" for the word above, \"for he said, I was a stranger,\" is like \"for Elohim has made me forget\" (Genesis 41:51), and I have already explained why he called the younger one's name Eliezer."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:35:26.351430813Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}